Text in sentences.jsonl in this directory is taken from books published by
Fundacja Wolne Lektury (https://wolnelektury.pl/). Every work used was originally
written or first published in 1950 or later, and is made available by Wolne Lektury
under one of these open licences (each line's "license" field says which; the
licence is stated in the footer of each source file):

* Creative Commons Attribution-ShareAlike 3.0 Poland (CC BY-SA 3.0 PL),
  https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/3.0/pl/
  (Andrzejewski, Kijowski, Wojdowski, Gliściński)
* Free Art License 1.3 (Licencja Wolnej Sztuki 1.3),
  https://artlibre.org/licence/lal/pl/
  (Papuzińska, Tulli, Fiedorczuk, Rak, Szostak, Orliński)

Both are share-alike licences: this file and sentences.jsonl may be redistributed
and modified only under the same licence as the work each sentence comes from.

Attribution (requested by Wolne Lektury, https://wolnelektury.pl/info/zasady-wykorzystania/):
source: Wolne Lektury, Fundacja Wolne Lektury. Each line records the author,
title, book page URL, the original writing/first-publication year ("written")
and the edition the digital text is based on ("edition").

Changes: the text was split into sentences, filtered (dialogue, quotations,
archaic spellings, foreign-language and short/long sentences removed), capped at
150 sentences per book and normalised to Unicode NFC. Wolne Lektury footnotes and
motifs are not included.
